            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Create & Share New Snippet</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Paste your large code block, select the language, and get an instant shareable cloud link.</p>
                    </div>
